# generator outcome per matrix `unsupported` (panic-class) construct — a SCORECARD, not a contract.
# PANIC = tracked-known gap (the matrix's `panic (exit 101)` verdict). Flipping it to `error (graceful)`
# is a FIX (re-bless); a new panic, or a panic decaying to a silently-wrong `ok`, is a regression.
# Generate-only: captures panic-class gaps only, not compile-class. Source: cddl-matrix/project_robustness.ts.

ctl.abnf                           PANIC
ctl.abnfb                          PANIC
ctl.and                            PANIC
ctl.bits                           PANIC
